      "bug_report": "## BUG: Plan and launch a survey mission\n\n**Verdict:** Business rule(s) R4 violated: The launched mission appears in the Missions list: expected text \"Survey 3baa1\" not found on /missions\n\n**Business goal:** An operator plans a mission with an available drone and it appears in the Missions list as Scheduled\n\n**Reproduce:**\n1. Open /missions/new\n2. Name the mission = 'Survey 3baa1'\n3. Choose mission type Survey = 'Survey'\n4. Choose the Pune Depot site = 'Pune Depot'\n5. Continue from mission details\n6. Fill new required field 'Pilot in command' = 'Argus test'\n7. Continue with 'Continue'\n8. Assign drone Falcon-1\n9. Continue from drone selection\n10. Set altitude to 80 m = '80'\n11. Set speed to 8 m/s = '8'\n12. Continue from flight parameters\n13. Launch the mission\n14. Open the Missions list\n\n**Expected vs actual:**\n- `assertion_failed` The launched mission appears in the Missions list: expected text \"Survey 3baa1\" not found on /missions\n\n**Release notes check:** none of the release notes explain this behaviour.\n\n**Evidence:** screenshots/create-mission_12.jpg, screenshots/create-mission_13.jpg",
